source: ASF Jira Server 8.20.10, POST /rest/api/1.0/render (hack/jira-render-evidence.py), captured 2026-08-24
observed: An accented letter is a word rune, so it refuses the candidate and kills the opener; Jira renders the line literally and jiro keeps it as text.
-- input.jira --
*a*é*
-- rendered.html --
<p>*a*é*</p>
-- want.md --
\*a\*é\*
-- warnings.json --
[]
